  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development hereby permitted shall be commenced before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.<br>",
    "The management of day-to-day noise from the premises shall be in accordance with the\r\nNoise Management Plan submitted in support of the application.&nbsp;",
    "&nbsp;&nbsp;Prior to first\r\noccupation, details including the design and location of all cycle parking spaces &nbsp;shall be submitted to and approved in\r\nwriting by the Local Planning authority. All cycle storage should be designed\r\nand laid out in accordance with the guidance contained in the London Cycling\r\nDesign Standards. \r\n\r\nThe approved details shall be implemented prior to first use of the\r\ndevelopment and thereafter permanently retained for the lifetime of the\r\ndevelopment",
    "Prior to first occupation of the\r\ndevelopment, details of the refuse and recycling bin storage&nbsp;including\r\ndesign and location of the refuse stores, has been submitted to and approved in\r\nwriting by the Local Planning Authority.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;The\r\napproved refuse stores shall be provided before the occupation of the\r\ndevelopment and thereafter permanently retained.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n",
    "&lt;p&gt;The development hereby approved shall only be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and documents:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Site Location Plan (dated: 31/01/2025)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Noise Management Plan (received:&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Design and Access Statement (dated: February 2025)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Cover Letter (dated: 01/02/2025)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Proposed First Floor Plan (drawing number: 77/BR/P/06, dated: February 2025)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Proposed Ground Floor Plan (drawing number: 77/BR/P/05, dated: February 2025).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Block Plan (drawing number: 77/BR/P/04, dated: February 2025).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;No other drawings or documents apply.&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
